   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Tangled Up in Blue** (1 review): The reviewer singles out the transition from this song into All Fall Down as extraordinary [4]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Tangled Up in Blue**: rare: 7 archived performances [5]\n- **Nashville Blues**: rare: 13 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2025-08-09.ak40** (recommended): audience recording; 24 songs; 158 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Recording is good, with a balanced level of audience participation audible [4]\n- **billystrings2025-08-09.Schoeps**: audience recording; 24 songs; 157 min [2]\n- **billystrings2025-08-09.Earsight**: audience recording; 24 songs; 157 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Taped from the left side of front-of-house, about 12 feet high, on a stand (OTS), with DINA setup; venue security allowed taping gear in [1]\n- Ethan Bone of the MN Timberwolves cleared the taping with Target Center, whose staff expected the taper [2]\n- Ethan Bone of the MN Timberwolves arranged clearance with Target Center, and staff there knew the taper was coming [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2025-08-09.ak40**: taped by Mike Rhoades; transferred by Mike Rhoades; source: AUD>Neumann (s)AK40>LC3KA>KM100>LunatecV3>ZoomF3(@32bit-float/96kHz) [1]. Also: Transfer chain: SoundForge15 with normalizing, fades, POW-r dither to 24-bit, tracked in CDWav, encoded to FLAC level 8, then tagged [1]\n- **billystrings2025-08-09.Schoeps**: taped by Cliff Morse; transferred by Cliff Morse; source: Aud>SD Flash [2]. Also: Taped and transferred by Cliff Morse; 32-bit float 48kHz converted via R8Brain, dithered and resampled to 24/48 and 16/44.1 formats [2]\n- **billystrings2025-08-09.Earsight**: taped by Cliff Morse; transferred by Cliff Morse; source: Aud>SD Flash [3]. Also: Cliff Morse recorded with Earsight Thumb mics, angled cardioid, into a Tascam FR-AV2 at 32-bit float, 48kHz [3]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Target Center 2025 - Regular Poster - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/target-center-2025-regular-poster/) [6]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Target Center 2025 - Regular Poster - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/target-center-2025-regular-poster/) [7]\n- Poster by BerryLittles: [Official Poster Billy Strings Target Center In Minneapolis MN August 9 2025 t-shirt, hoodie, sweater, long sleeve and ta](https://berrylittles.com/product/official-poster-billy-strings-target-center-in-minneapolis-mn-august-9-2025-t-shirt/) [8]",
